        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Alteryx overview</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    background: #fff;\n    color: #000;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 12px 26px 20px 26px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n  }\n  .page { width: 1024px; margin: 0 auto; position: relative; }\n\n  /* top-right tag stack */\n  .tag-stack {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    right: 0;\n    width: 158px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .tag-stack div {\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    padding: 2px 0;\n    margin-bottom: 2px;\n  }\n  .tag-stack .t1 { background: #5b83b3; }\n  .tag-stack .t2 { background: #7d9cc4; }\n  .tag-stack .t3 { background: #93aed1; }\n  .tag-stack .t4 { background: #a3bad9; }\n  .tag-stack .t5 { background: #b3c7e0; }\n  .tag-stack .t6 { background: #c1d1e6; }\n  .tag-stack .t7 { background: #cddbec; }\n\n  h1 {\n    color: #4d7cb2;\n    font-size: 27px;\n    font-weight: normal;\n    margin: 62px 0 0 0;\n  }\n\n  .logo {\n    text-align: right;\n    color: #2b6ca3;\n    font-size: 28px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: -0.5px;\n    margin: 14px 90px 8px 0;\n  }\n\n  .columns { display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: flex-start; }\n  .col-left { width: 430px; }\n  .col-right { flex: 1; }\n\n  .bar {\n    background: #5b82b0;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    padding: 4px 10px;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n\n  ul.b {\n    list-style: none;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0 0 0 14px;\n  }\n  ul.b > li {\n    position: relative;\n    padding-left: 12px;\n    margin-bottom: 7px;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n  }\n  ul.b > li:before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 4px;\n    width: 5px;\n    height: 5px;\n    background: #5b82b0;\n  }\n  ul.b ul.b { margin-top: 7px; padding-left: 18px; }\n\n  /* Management table */\n  table.mgmt {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-size: 11px;\n  }\n  table.mgmt th, table.mgmt td {\n    text-align: left;\n    font-weight: normal;\n    padding: 3px 4px;\n    vertical-align: top;\n  }\n  table.mgmt thead th { border-bottom: 1px solid #999; }\n  table.mgmt tbody tr td { border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc; }\n  table.mgmt col.c1 { width: 33%; }\n  table.mgmt col.c2 { width: 27%; }\n\n  /* Investors */\n  .investors-logo {\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 8px 0 10px 0;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #999;\n  }\n  .investors-logo span {\n    color: #2f5c9e;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n  }\n  table.cap {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-size: 11px;\n  }\n  table.cap td {\n    padding: 3px 4px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;\n  }\n  table.cap td.val { width: 45%; }\n  .source { font-size: 9px; margin-top: 3px; }\n\n  /* Products overview rows */\n  .prow { display: flex; border-bottom: 1px solid #bbb; }\n  .prow:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid #bbb; }\n  .plabel {\n    background: #4a76ab;\n    color: #fff;\n    width: 26px;\n    min-width: 26px;\n    position: relative;\n    margin: 2px 0;\n  }\n  .plabel span {\n    display: block;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    transform: rotate(-90deg);\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 50%;\n    left: 50%;\n    transform-origin: center;\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-90deg);\n    font-size: 11px;\n  }\n  .pbody { padding: 6px 0 6px 14px; flex: 1; }\n\n  /* Key customers */\n  .customers {\n    padding: 10px 6px;\n  }\n  .cust-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    border: 1px dashed #bbb;\n    color: #666;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .pagenum {\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #555;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    margin-top: 60px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"tag-stack\">\n    <div class=\"t1\">Analytics and Visualization</div>\n    <div class=\"t2\">Machine data</div>\n    <div class=\"t3\">Marketing &amp; e-commerce</div>\n    <div class=\"t4\">Social</div>\n    <div class=\"t5\">Market places</div>\n    <div class=\"t6\">Location/events</div>\n    <div class=\"t7\">Statistical</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <h1>Alteryx overview</h1>\n\n  <div class=\"logo\">alteryx</div>\n\n  <div class=\"columns\">\n\n    <!-- LEFT COLUMN -->\n    <div class=\"col-left\">\n      <div class=\"bar\">Business overview</div>\n      <ul class=\"b\">\n        <li>Provides an easy-to-use analytics platform for enterprise companies making critical decisions that drive their business strategy and growth</li>\n        <li>Humanizes Big Data by enabling business analysts and Data Artisans to combine Big Data with market knowledge, location insight and business intelligence</li>\n        <li>Performs predictive and spatial analytics and produces analytic apps that can be shared via the private cloud or the Alteryx Analytics Gallery public cloud</li>\n        <li>End markets: Automotive, commercial real estate, restaurants and entertainment, fast moving consumer goods, retail franchising and telecommunications</li>\n        <li>Has 250+ customers and 200,000+ users worldwide</li>\n        <li>Founded in 1997</li>\n        <li>Headquartered in Irvine, CA\n          <ul class=\"b\">\n            <li>Also has offices in Boulder and Silicon Valley</li>\n          </ul>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <div class=\"bar\" style=\"margin-top:22px;\">Management</div>\n      <table class=\"mgmt\">\n        <colgroup>\n          <col class=\"c1\"><col class=\"c2\"><col>\n        </colgroup>\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th>Name</th>\n            <th>Title</th>\n            <th>Affiliations/experience</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td>Dean Stoecker</td>\n            <td>Chairman &amp; CEO</td>\n            <td>Integration Technologies, Donnelly Marketing Information Services</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>George Mathew</td>\n            <td>President &amp; Chief Operating Officer</td>\n            <td>SAP, salesforce.com, Fort Point Partners</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>Gary Acord</td>\n            <td>CFO</td>\n            <td>KPMG, KACE</td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n\n      <div class=\"bar\" style=\"margin-top:22px;\">Investors</div>\n      <div class=\"investors-logo\">\n        <span>SAP&nbsp;VENTURES</span>\n      </div>\n      <table class=\"cap\">\n        <tr>\n          <td>Total capital raised:</td>\n          <td class=\"val\">$6.0mm</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Last round:</td>\n          <td class=\"val\">Series A, $6.0mm</td>\n        </tr>\n      </table>\n      <div class=\"source\">Source: Company information, Capital IQ</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- RIGHT COLUMN -->\n    <div class=\"col-right\">\n      <div class=\"bar\">Products overview</div>\n\n      <div class=\"prow\">\n        <div class=\"plabel\"><span>Designer desktop</span></div>\n        <div class=\"pbody\">\n          <ul class=\"b\">\n            <li>Point-and-click UI: Builds analytics with no coding</li>\n            <li>Personal ETL: Pulls data from internal, Big Data, or cloud</li>\n            <li>Data quality tools: Builds clean and credible data sets for analysis</li>\n            <li>Predictive Analytics: Pre-built R tool makes predictive accessible to all</li>\n            <li>Agile database: Takes on structured, un-structured and spatial data</li>\n            <li>Single-click publishing: Shares analytic apps iPrivate Cloud or Alteryx Analytic Gallery</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"prow\">\n        <div class=\"plabel\"><span>Analytic apps</span></div>\n        <div class=\"pbody\">\n          <ul class=\"b\">\n            <li>Ad hoc analysis in minutes: Designs and redesign scenarios on the fly</li>\n            <li>Provides interactive charts and maps</li>\n            <li>Offers spatial analysis</li>\n            <li>Apps builder: Creates and shares analytic apps with a drag-and-drop wizard</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"prow\">\n        <div class=\"plabel\"><span>Cloud server</span></div>\n        <div class=\"pbody\">\n          <ul class=\"b\">\n            <li>Integrates Alteryx data, insights and applications into other systems with open API and SDK</li>\n            <li>Publishes and shares analytic applications with full control over access, visibility and sharing</li>\n            <li>Enables scheduled, event-triggered and ad-hoc analysis to support critical decisions across companies</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"prow\">\n        <div class=\"plabel\"><span>API</span></div>\n        <div class=\"pbody\">\n          <ul class=\"b\">\n            <li>Provides consumerization of Big Data Analytics</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bar\" style=\"margin-top:22px;\">Key customers</div>\n      <div class=\"customers\">\n        <div class=\"cust-row\">\n          <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:90px;height:46px;\">[Logo: AT&amp;T]</div>\n          <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:150px;height:46px;\">[Logo: Comcast SPOTLIGHT]</div>\n          <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:230px;height:46px;\">[Logo: Newham University Hospital NHS Trust]</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"cust-row\" style=\"justify-content:space-around;\">\n          <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:150px;height:36px;\">[Logo: Experian]</div>\n          <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:150px;height:36px;\">[Logo: TERADATA]</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pagenum\">14</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
